# dotctl waybar decorator - pointed (Powerline chevrons)
# This is the canonical form. Canonical console variants ship pointed glyphs,
# so this file is the identity (no substitutions).
#
# Format: each non-comment line is `FROM TO` as bare 4-digit hex codepoints
# (whitespace-separated). At apply time dotctl substitutes both the JSON
# escape form (\uFROM -> \uTO) and any literal glyph occurrences in
# config.jsonc. Hex - not literal glyphs - because PUA glyphs are invisible
# in editors and get silently dropped by text tooling.
